B.a96=new A.tX("LEGAL DRAFT \u2014 NOT YET APPROVED OR PUBLISHED. These summaries are for product review and must be completed with the legal operator details and reviewed by a qualified Nigerian lawyer before being treated as binding documents.",null)
B.a5e=new A.a6("Privacy notice \u2014 draft",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.a9z=new A.hE("Who operates OminiPay","The legal name, registered address and contact details of the OminiPay operating entity must be inserted before publication. Until then, this draft does not identify a complete data controller.",null)
B.a9B=new A.hE("Information the app may process","Depending on the features you use, OminiPay may process account and contact details, profile information, wallet and transaction records, payout beneficiary details, device and diagnostic information, and support messages. Identity documents must not be collected through informal support channels. The final notice must be checked against the actual deployed data flows.",null)
B.a9C=new A.hE("How information is used","Information may be used to create and secure accounts, operate wallets and transfers, process requested payouts, prevent fraud, provide support, maintain records, and meet applicable legal obligations. The final notice must state the specific lawful bases and purposes for each activity.",null)
B.a9H=new A.hE("Sharing and service providers","Information may be shared with payment, banking, identity verification, hosting and security providers only as needed to deliver requested services or meet legal obligations. The final notice must identify relevant provider categories, cross-border transfers and safeguards.",null)
B.a9G=new A.hE("Security and retention","OminiPay should apply access controls and appropriate technical and organisational safeguards. Records should be kept only for documented operational, dispute and legal retention periods. Exact retention periods and safeguards must be confirmed before publication.",null)
B.a9A=new A.hE("Your privacy rights and contact","The final notice must explain applicable rights under the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023, how to make a request, how to complain to the Nigeria Data Protection Commission, and the verified privacy contact or data protection officer.",null)
